[RISK] wf.yml:4: echo ${{ secrets.* }}
       why: secret value is written to stdout and persisted in the run log
[RISK] wf.yml:4: set -x / set +x
       why: shell xtrace prints every expanded command, including secret env values
[RISK] wf.yml:4: toJSON(secrets)
       why: serializes the entire secrets context — any later echo, env, or file write leaks them all
